<title>USA: WTD Industries fails to sell sawmill.</title>
<headline>WTD Industries fails to sell sawmill.</headline>
<dateline>PORTLAND, Ore. 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>WTD Industries Inc said Wednesday it has failed to reach a definitive agreement for the sale of its Vermont sawmill facility.</p>
<p>WTD said in a statement that in July it had reached an agreement in principle for the sale, subject to numerous contingencies. The Vermont facility will continue to operate under WTD ownership.</p>
<p>WTD operates facilities in Oregon, Washington and Vermont, producing softwood and hardwood lumber products.</p>
</text>
